00:33:54.160 --> 00:34:03.160
So with current conditions and
expectations, the changes on a month by
month basis in terms of points.

00:34:03.160 --> 00:34:08.160
And you'll also see that for the aggregate
index as well.

00:34:08.160 --> 00:34:19.160
So you'll find as well in the spreadsheets
that we've taken the data and created a
whole bunch of visuals.

00:34:19.160 --> 00:34:22.160
So charts from the data.

00:34:22.160 --> 00:34:33.160
If we look here, the main one is the
