what you can see is that when we have
multiple readings throughout the data set
above 80, this is generally very obviously
associated with positive direction in the
stock market and very good percentage
returns annually in the S&P 500.

00:53:38.160 --> 00:53:52.160
In our next zone, when we look at the 70
